# Line endings are a measurement hazard here, not a style preference.
#
# Sentence splitting, punctuation profiles and the thrash detector's sentence
# alignment all run over stored corpus text. If git rewrote CRLF <-> LF on checkout,
# the same passage would hash differently and could tokenise differently on Windows
# than on Linux CI, so a metric could move without anyone editing anything.
#
# Corpus and result artifacts are therefore byte-frozen; source and docs normalise.
* text=auto eol=lf

data/corpus/** -text
results/** -text
*.jsonl -text
